# Repository Configuration Error

## What is the error?

The alias `{{ alias }}` sets the parameter `{{ name }}` to `{{ value }}`, which is not one of the values that the `values` key of the parameter allows.

## What to do?

Change the value in the `params` of the alias `{{ alias }}`, or add `{{ value }}` to the `values` key of the parameter `{{ name }}`, then commit the change.

See the [documentation](https://stategraph.com/docs/reference/orchestration/configuration/parameters) for the parameters configuration.
